  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat the oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "2. In a large bowl, mix together the mnutty flour, eggs, and bisque.",
    "3. Add the sweetcorn and mix well.",
    "4. Heat the molten butter in a non-stick pan over medium heat.",
    "5. Using a spoon, drop the mixture into the pan and flatten slightly.",
    "6. Cook for 2-3 minutes on each side, or until golden brown.",
    "7. Transfer the fritters to a baking sheet and bake for 10-12 minutes.",
    "8. Serve warm and enjoy!"
